de_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1535288-clade-companion-advanced-release-is-out?p=1535348#post1535348\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll keep you both in mind the next time I'm planning a new project. I'm getting pretty close to finishing the first draft of Black Vans, so it won't be that. But I eventually want to do some kind of Night Horrors book, and that would definitely benefit from having more creatives involved in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I too would love to potentially partake in helping out with adding content to a Night Horror's book. I've been thinking about that sentient tree and came up with an idea:<br /> <br /> An Uplifted Coactive tree that can communicate through the use of Illusions (Hologram variation), can understand people and creatures through mind reading (Telepathy variation) and while it IS just a tree, it can move from place to place va a teleportation variation. As long as it's not observed (Scar, power failure). So why would anyone, let alone conspiracies, want to bother the tree? Because of the fruit it bares (Sacred Flesh variation). Eating the fruit gives anyone the same powers as the tree. But it's not easy. Those Holograms can become very real, and the tree has killed before with it's strong branches. bodies have been used to fertilize it before, why not one more?<br /> <br /> A few other ideas for Deviants/Conspiracies:<br /> <br /> A Conspiracy whose goal is to infiltrate the other supernatural societies in the Chroniciles of darkness using Devoted &quot;decoys&quot;.<br /> <br /> A Psychic amalgamation hit-man who sells their talents to other organizations. He adds the minds and souls of the people he kills to his own to augment his power. (use of the fractal variation to make copies of himself each with the mind of a different victim he's killed. Variations: Omnicompentant, Body thief.<br /> <br /> A conspiracy run by a large criminal organization where people, usually other criminals, pay top dollar for physical enhancements. Usually create Chimeric Deviants.<br /> <br /> A Deviant powered by the Abyss that eats the magic of Mages.<br /> <br /> An Uplifted Manticore or spirit<br /> <br /> An Invasive powered by an engine that runs on the Divine Fire and haunted by the proto-soul of the Promethean who he stole it from.<br /> <br /> Just a few ideas to get the creative juices flowing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3857-kingme1","user":"Kingme1","date":". 05-14-2024, 11:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3857-kingme1","name":"Kingme1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}